{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CgBL2v7yAScs37gRPJTvE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_read_input_tokens":53507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dbd587e-a294-4bb7-b473-d9b8013ef4bd","uuid":"beec0cbc-7c97-4889-b17e-03712559f1a1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:05:27.232Z","request_id":"req_011CgBL2urarPpqt7rg5PEYC"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CgBL2v7yAScs37gRPJTvE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Leunae96wkNAa616eDin1x","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/intake/user-stories.md","content":"# User Stories — PRD-03 User Management, Profiles, Family Links & Audit Viewer\n\nTicket: abcd-03 · Phase: intake\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- **FR-1** As an admin, I want student/teacher/parent profile data and parent↔student link records to exist so that every user-management screen has somewhere to read and write role-specific data.\n- **FR-2** As an admin, I want a user list table with avatar, name, email, role, status and grade level columns so that I can scan everyone at a glance.\n- **FR-3** As an admin, I want to filter and search the user list by role, status, grade level and free text so that I can find people fast.\n- **FR-4** As an admin, I want per-row actions (view, edit, resend invite, unlock, disable/enable, archive/restore) so that I can manage one account at a time.\n- **FR-5** As an admin, I want bulk actions (resend invitations, disable, export CSV) on selected rows so that I can manage many accounts at once.\n- **FR-6** As an admin, I want a stepped create/edit form with role-specific fields so that I can create a user of any role with the right data.\n- **FR-7** As an admin, I want a \"send invitation email now\" option on user creation so that new users can sign in right away.\n- **FR-8** As an admin, I want a confirmation dialog when changing a user's email so that pending invite tokens are safely invalidated.\n- **FR-9** As an admin, I want a user's role locked after creation so that role changes can't silently break access rules.\n- **FR-10** As an admin, I want date-of-birth and phone fields validated so that bad data never enters a student or contact record.\n- **FR-11** As an admin, I want a user detail page showing profile, status, family links and recent audit entries so that I have full context on one screen.\n- **FR-12** As an admin, I want disabling a user to cut off their active sessions within 5 minutes so that access removal is prompt.\n- **FR-13** As an admin, I want archiving a user to hide them from pickers while keeping their historical records so that past data stays intact.\n- **FR-14** As an admin, I want to be blocked from disabling myself or the last active admin so that the school never loses admin access.\n- **FR-15** As an admin, I want to manage parent–student links from the student form, the parent form or a Family card so that I have flexible entry points.\n- **FR-16** As an admin, I want at most 4 parents per student and exactly one marked primary so that family data stays well-formed.\n- **FR-17** As a developer of a later PRD, I want `getAccessibleStudentIds` and `assertCanViewStudent` helpers so that every feature enforces student-level access the same way.\n- **FR-18** As an admin, I want downloadable CSV templates for students and teachers so that I know the exact columns to fill in.\n- **FR-19** As an admin, I want a client-side CSV preview marking each row Valid/Warning/Error so that I can fix problems before importing.\n- **FR-20** As an admin, I want the import to happen in server-validated batches of 200 inside one transaction per batch so that imports are safe and fast.\n- **FR-21** As an admin, I want to optionally send invitations after import and have grade levels matched case-insensitively so that onboarding a whole year is low-friction.\n- **FR-22** As an admin, I want an import summary and a downloadable error report so that I can see exactly what happened to each row.\n- **FR-23** As an admin, I want re-importing the same file to skip existing users instead of duplicating them so that imports are safe to retry.\n- **FR-24** As any authenticated user with access, I want a student detail page with an Overview tab (profile, family, emergency contact) so that I can see a student's core information.\n- **FR-25** As any user, I want the student detail page to enforce `assertCanViewStudent` so that I can't see students I'm not allowed to see.\n- **FR-26** As a parent, I want a \"My children\" page listing my linked students so that I can jump to each child's information.\n- **FR-27** As any user, I want a profile page where I can edit my phone (and occupation/address if I'm a parent) so that the school can reach me.\n- **FR-28** As an admin or teacher, I want a searchable user picker (`/api/users/search` + `UserPicker`) so that I can quickly find and select people in forms.\n- **FR-29** As an admin, I want a read-only audit log viewer with filters and a metadata drawer so that I can see who changed what.\n- **FR-30** As any user, I want the sidebar and user menu updated with the new pages (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children, Profile) so that I can navigate to them.\n- **FR-31** As an admin, I want an \"unlock\" action that clears a locked-out account's lockout fields so that a legitimately locked user can sign in again without waiting out the timer.\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n- **NFR-1 (Privacy)** Medical notes are never exposed to STUDENT or PARENT roles, in the API or in CSV exports.\n- **NFR-2 (Performance)** The user list returns a page in under 300 ms with 5,000 users.\n- **NFR-3 (Reliability)** CSV import batches are all-or-nothing — no partial persistence on failure.\n- **NFR-4 (Security)** CSV exports neutralise spreadsheet formula injection.\n- **NFR-5 (UI consistency)** Every visible element is built from Material UI, looked up via the MUI MCP server; banned UI/styling libraries are rejected by ESLint.\n- **NFR-6 (Test coverage)** Unit, integration and Playwright e2e tests as listed in the PRD's Test Requirements section.\n- **NFR-7 (Brownfield discipline)** Reuse PRD-00/01/02 models, services, components and helpers; never re-scaffold, duplicate, or rename.\n- **NFR-8 (Delivery discipline)** Keep lint/typecheck/test green, stay within this PRD's scope, and don't touch later-PRD behaviour.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":544,"cache_read_input_tokens":53507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":544},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dbd587e-a294-4bb7-b473-d9b8013ef4bd","uuid":"d780b5bf-3e20-48b2-8ff0-8c9bd508f85b","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:05:46.044Z","request_id":"req_011CgBL2urarPpqt7rg5PEYC"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Leunae96wkNAa616eDin1x","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/intake/user-stories.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dbd587e-a294-4bb7-b473-d9b8013ef4bd","uuid":"5f9adb8b-d67f-4eb2-ae87-9d811c70e3e1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:05:46.070Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/intake/user-stories.md","content":"# User Stories — PRD-03 User Management, Profiles, Family Links & Audit Viewer\n\nTicket: abcd-03 · Phase: intake\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- **FR-1** As an admin, I want student/teacher/parent profile data and parent↔student link records to exist so that every user-management screen has somewhere to read and write role-specific data.\n- **FR-2** As an admin, I want a user list table with avatar, name, email, role, status and grade level columns so that I can scan everyone at a glance.\n- **FR-3** As an admin, I want to filter and search the user list by role, status, grade level and free text so that I can find people fast.\n- **FR-4** As an admin, I want per-row actions (view, edit, resend invite, unlock, disable/enable, archive/restore) so that I can manage one account at a time.\n- **FR-5** As an admin, I want bulk actions (resend invitations, disable, export CSV) on selected rows so that I can manage many accounts at once.\n- **FR-6** As an admin, I want a stepped create/edit form with role-specific fields so that I can create a user of any role with the right data.\n- **FR-7** As an admin, I want a \"send invitation email now\" option on user creation so that new users can sign in right away.\n- **FR-8** As an admin, I want a confirmation dialog when changing a user's email so that pending invite tokens are safely invalidated.\n- **FR-9** As an admin, I want a user's role locked after creation so that role changes can't silently break access rules.\n- **FR-10** As an admin, I want date-of-birth and phone fields validated so that bad data never enters a student or contact record.\n- **FR-11** As an admin, I want a user detail page showing profile, status, family links and recent audit entries so that I have full context on one screen.\n- **FR-12** As an admin, I want disabling a user to cut off their active sessions within 5 minutes so that access removal is prompt.\n- **FR-13** As an admin, I want archiving a user to hide them from pickers while keeping their historical records so that past data stays intact.\n- **FR-14** As an admin, I want to be blocked from disabling myself or the last active admin so that the school never loses admin access.\n- **FR-15** As an admin, I want to manage parent–student links from the student form, the parent form or a Family card so that I have flexible entry points.\n- **FR-16** As an admin, I want at most 4 parents per student and exactly one marked primary so that family data stays well-formed.\n- **FR-17** As a developer of a later PRD, I want `getAccessibleStudentIds` and `assertCanViewStudent` helpers so that every feature enforces student-level access the same way.\n- **FR-18** As an admin, I want downloadable CSV templates for students and teachers so that I know the exact columns to fill in.\n- **FR-19** As an admin, I want a client-side CSV preview marking each row Valid/Warning/Error so that I can fix problems before importing.\n- **FR-20** As an admin, I want the import to happen in server-validated batches of 200 inside one transaction per batch so that imports are safe and fast.\n- **FR-21** As an admin, I want to optionally send invitations after import and have grade levels matched case-insensitively so that onboarding a whole year is low-friction.\n- **FR-22** As an admin, I want an import summary and a downloadable error report so that I can see exactly what happened to each row.\n- **FR-23** As an admin, I want re-importing the same file to skip existing users instead of duplicating them so that imports are safe to retry.\n- **FR-24** As any authenticated user with access, I want a student detail page with an Overview tab (profile, family, emergency contact) so that I can see a student's core information.\n- **FR-25** As any user, I want the student detail page to enforce `assertCanViewStudent` so that I can't see students I'm not allowed to see.\n- **FR-26** As a parent, I want a \"My children\" page listing my linked students so that I can jump to each child's information.\n- **FR-27** As any user, I want a profile page where I can edit my phone (and occupation/address if I'm a parent) so that the school can reach me.\n- **FR-28** As an admin or teacher, I want a searchable user picker (`/api/users/search` + `UserPicker`) so that I can quickly find and select people in forms.\n- **FR-29** As an admin, I want a read-only audit log viewer with filters and a metadata drawer so that I can see who changed what.\n- **FR-30** As any user, I want the sidebar and user menu updated with the new pages (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children, Profile) so that I can navigate to them.\n- **FR-31** As an admin, I want an \"unlock\" action that clears a locked-out account's lockout fields so that a legitimately locked user can sign in again without waiting out the timer.\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n- **NFR-1 (Privacy)** Medical notes are never exposed to STUDENT or PARENT roles, in the API or in CSV exports.\n- **NFR-2 (Performance)** The user list returns a page in under 300 ms with 5,000 users.\n- **NFR-3 (Reliability)** CSV import batches are all-or-nothing — no partial persistence on failure.\n- **NFR-4 (Security)** CSV exports neutralise spreadsheet formula injection.\n- **NFR-5 (UI consistency)** Every visible element is built from Material UI, looked up via the MUI MCP server; banned UI/styling libraries are rejected by ESLint.\n- **NFR-6 (Test coverage)** Unit, integration and Playwright e2e tests as listed in the PRD's Test Requirements section.\n- **NFR-7 (Brownfield discipline)** Reuse PRD-00/01/02 models, services, components and helpers; never re-scaffold, duplicate, or rename.\n- **NFR-8 (Delivery discipline)** Keep lint/typecheck/test green, stay within this PRD's scope, and don't touch later-PRD behaviour.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":72,"newStart":1,"newLines":48,"lines":["-# User Stories — PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & Role-Based Access Control","+# User Stories — PRD-03 User Management, Profiles, Family Links & Audit Viewer"," ","-Ticket: abcd-2 · Phase: intake","+Ticket: abcd-03 · Phase: intake"," ","-## Data model","+## Functional Requirements"," ","-- As the platform, I need User, AuthToken and AuditLog models with role/status/lockout fields, so that every later feature can authenticate, scope and audit users against one source of truth. (FR-1)","+- **FR-1** As an admin, I want student/teacher/parent profile data and parent↔student link records to exist so that every user-management screen has somewhere to read and write role-specific data.","+- **FR-2** As an admin, I want a user list table with avatar, name, email, role, status and grade level columns so that I can scan everyone at a glance.","+- **FR-3** As an admin, I want to filter and search the user list by role, status, grade level and free text so that I can find people fast.","+- **FR-4** As an admin, I want per-row actions (view, edit, resend invite, unlock, disable/enable, archive/restore) so that I can manage one account at a time.","+- **FR-5** As an admin, I want bulk actions (resend invitations, disable, export CSV) on selected rows so that I can manage many accounts at once.","+- **FR-6** As an admin, I want a stepped create/edit form with role-specific fields so that I can create a user of any role with the right data.","+- **FR-7** As an admin, I want a