{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":109194,"num_turns":19,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"35fc3024-b10f-4ae9-982f-2a29733c9479","total_cost_usd":0.5941401,"usage":{"input_tokens":38,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33149,"cache_read_input_tokens":784407,"output_tokens":10654,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":51231,"cache_creation_input_tokens":346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":346},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":38,"outputTokens":10654,"cacheReadInputTokens":784407,"cacheCreationInputTokens":33149,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5941401,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Intake for **abcd-04** (PRD-04, Notifications & Email Infrastructure) is complete.\n\n- `requirements.json` — 24 FRs + 10 NFRs, all HIGH/MEDIUM confidence (97% aggregate), no clarification rounds needed.\n- `user-stories.md` — stories per FR, NFR section at the end.\n- `tech-stack.json` — `react` (Next.js/MUI, confirmed against the existing repo), no new preprocessor.\n- `figma-readiness.json` — skipped, no Figma URL in this PRD.\n- `handoff-to-architect.json` — written last, `status: complete`.\n\nNotable finding carried into FR-9/FR-23 (flagged for the Architect, not blocking): `sendInvite()` in `src/server/services/users.ts` is currently a logging-only stub (\"PRD-01 auth not landed yet\"), and `src/config/navigation.ts` only has a Dashboard entry today — both need real wiring in this PRD, cited with