ton to APP_URL + link).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"Switch the existing PRD-01 auth email path onto the outbox: replace the current sendInvite() stub in src/server/services/users.ts (which only logs \\\"PRD-01 auth not landed yet\\\") with a sendAuthEmail() helper that enqueues the invite / password-reset templates via EmailOutbox.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.4; verified against src/server/services/users.ts:385-390 where sendInvite is currently a logging-only stub\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"Implement dispatchEmails({ batchSize = 50 }) that selects PENDING rows with nextAttemptAt <= now using FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, marks them SENDING, sends via Nodemailer, and marks SENT or schedules a retry.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Dispatcher, point 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"Apply the retry schedule: attempts 1-5 back off at 1, 5, 15, 60 and 240 minutes; mark FAILED after the 5th failure.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5.2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Expose POST /api/internal/email/dispatch protected by header Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET} for an external scheduler, and an npm run worker:email script that loops dispatchEmails every 15 seconds for local/simple deployments.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5.3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Add env vars SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASS, SMTP_SECURE, EMAIL_FROM, CRON_SECRET, EMAIL_TRANSPORT (smtp|console, default console in dev); console transport logs subject, recipient and text body.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5.4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"Replace the existing placeholder bell icon (currently a static Badge badgeContent={0} in src/app/(app)/shell.tsx line ~141) with a live unread-count bell: MUI IconButton + Badge, polling GET /api/notifications/unread-count every 30s while the tab is visible, paused on visibilitychange hidden, displaying \\\"9+\\\" above 9.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.1; verified against src/app/(app)/shell.tsx:141 current static Badge\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Clicking the bell opens an MUI Popover with a List of the 10 most recent notifications (unread bold with a dot, title, 2-line-clamped body, relative time); clicking an item marks it read and navigates to its link. Footer actions: \\\"Mark all as read\\\" and \\\"View all\\\".\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"Build the /notifications page: paginated list (20/page), All/Unread filter tabs, category filter, bulk \\\"Mark all as read\\\", per-row mark read/unread toggle.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7.1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"Implement purgeOldNotifications() to delete notifications older than 180 days, invoked from the dispatcher endpoint once per day (in-memory last-run tracking; acceptable to re-run after a restart).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7.2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"Build /account/notifications preferences page: MUI Table grouped by category (ListSubheader-style group rows), each visible type shows label, description, an In-app switch and an Email switch; mandatory in-app types show a disabled Switch with tooltip \\\"Required by the school\\\".\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8.1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"Preference changes save immediately via PUT /api/me/notification-preferences with optimistic UI and rollback on error.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8.2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"Build the admin /admin/email-log page: table of created/recipient/subject/status/attempts/last-error, filterable by status, with a \\\"Retry now\\\" row action for FAILED rows 