":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T00:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 49,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 94,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"FR-1/FR-31 (MEDIUM): AuditLog already exists with column 'ip' (PRD block says 'ipAddress') and different indexes. Intake assumes keep 'ip' (no renames) and add only the missing indexes plus User @@index([role, status]).\",\n    \"FR-20 (MEDIUM): EmailOutbox model exists but no src/server/notifications code was found. Intake assumes sendAuthEmail() logs via logger.info per the PRD's Out of Scope bullet.\",\n    \"FR-27 (MEDIUM): existing setUserStatus is (actorId, userId, status), not the PRD's (userId, status). Intake assumes the existing signature is kept.\",\n    \"Brownfield gaps the architect must design for: no middleware.ts, no Auth.js config, no src/server/auth/tokens.ts (even though schema.prisma's doc comment names it), no rate-limit.ts, no public-routes.ts. requireRole() has 44 callers, so its signature must stay stable. useToast lives at src/components/Toast/, not src/components/shared/.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JgWfcn65FErfX3EdpzFs1N","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
