 strict, Prisma/PostgreSQL 16, and MUI v9 with emotion. Every dependency this PRD needs is already installed: nodemailer ^6.9.14 (+ @types/nodemailer), @react-email/components 0.0.25 and @react-email/render 1.0.1. tsx is used by the existing worker:email script. Styling uses only the MUI theme, sx and styled(); Tailwind and CSS modules are banned. Email templates are the only non-MUI rendering and are exempt per the PRD.\",","+  \"detectionNotes\": \"The run mode explicitly declares '--tech-stack react', and the workspace confirms it: Next.js 14 App Router, React 18, TypeScript strict, Prisma/PostgreSQL 16, and MUI 9.5.0 with emotion. Already installed for this PRD: @mui/x-date-pickers 9.5.0 (TimeField), date-fns 3.6.0 and date-fns-tz 3.2.0. One new dependency is needed: @dnd-kit/core (non-visual, explicitly allowed; pin the version). @dnd-kit/sortable is not needed if period reorder uses up/down buttons. Styling uses only the MUI theme, sx and styled(). The print layout uses an @media print rule via the theme or GlobalStyles, with no CSS modules.\",","   \"cssPreprocessor\": \"css\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-4\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"techStack\": \"react\",\n  \"confidencePct\": 100,\n  \"detectionNotes\": \"The run mode explicitly declares '--tech-stack react', and the workspace confirms it: Next.js 14 App Router, React 18, TypeScript strict, Prisma/PostgreSQL 16, and MUI v9 with emotion. Every dependency this PRD needs is already installed: nodemailer ^6.9.14 (+ @types/nodemailer), @react-email/components 0.0.25 and @react-email/render 1.0.1. tsx is used by the existing worker:email script. Styling uses only the MUI theme, sx and styled(); Tailwind and CSS modules are banned. Email templates are the only non-MUI rendering and are exempt per the PRD.\",\n  \"cssPreprocessor\": \"css\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Mzw4ED811BxdtWT