{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R5KLSirjDczegGK6SRmtuu","type":"tool_result","content":"# Project Knowledge Base\n<!-- Generated by Cortana Knowledge Builder -- vendor-agnostic, works with any AI tool -->\n<!-- Last updated: 2026-11-04T06:31:57.058Z -->\n\n## Overview\n- **Name**: schoolhub\n- **Type**: data-engineering (0.85% confidence)\n- **Language**: typescript\n- **Framework**: react\n\n## What This System Does\n\n### Page Routes\n- `/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment`\n- `/(app)/admin/courses`\n- `/(app)/admin/sections/[id]`\n- `/(app)/admin/sections`\n- `/(app)/courses/[courseId]`\n- `/(app)/courses/[courseId]/roster`\n- `/(app)/dashboard`\n- `/(app)/my-courses`\n- `/(app)/students/[id]/courses`\n- `/(public)`\n\n### Capabilities (from tests)\n- dashboard page (/dashboard)\n- landing page (/)\n- ConfirmDialog\n- DataTable\n- formatInSchoolTz\n- env.ts\n- no-restricted-imports (ADR-5: MUI-only)\n- ok/paginated/apiError envelopes\n- withHandler error mapping\n- parsePagination\n- parseBody / parseQuery\n- checkCapacityOrThrow\n- enrollSectionCoreCourses\n- dropSectionCoreCourses\n- moveStudentSection\n- useToast / ToastProvider\n\n### NPM Scripts\n- `dev`: `next dev`\n- `build`: `next build`\n- `start`: `next start`\n- `lint`: `next lint`\n- `typecheck`: `tsc --noEmit`\n- `test`: `vitest run`\n- `test:e2e`: `playwright test`\n- `db:migrate`: `prisma migrate dev`\n- `db:deploy`: `prisma migrate deploy`\n- `db:seed`: `tsx prisma/seed.ts`\n- `db:reset`: `prisma migrate reset --force`\n- `worker:email`: `tsx scripts/worker-email.ts`\n- `format`: `prettier --write .`\n\n## Tech Stack\n| Component | Choice | Version |\n|-----------|--------|---------|\nprisma:\nmigrations\nschema.prisma\nseed.ts\n\nprisma/migrations:\n20261019000000_init\n20261019151500_user_management_profiles\n20261027000000_classes_enrollment\n20261104000000_auth_reconcile\n20261104120000_notifications_email\n20261105000000_timetable\nmigration_lock.to