{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjKQBXFnKgynzG9GxK4j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fyjei4qtZeenWjqa7KB7BR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T06:34:34Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 49,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 97,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"BROWNFIELD: most of the PRD-01 backend already exists (schema, tokens.ts, credentials.ts, auth.ts session, middleware, rate-limit, audit, validators, services/auth.ts, services/users.ts, all API routes, requireRole.ts). Design only the gaps and do not rebuild these.\",\n    \"GAPS to design: the (auth) pages /login, /forgot-password, /reset-password/[token] and /invite/[token]; the /account/security page; deleting PLACEHOLDER_USER from shell.tsx and wiring the session user, role badge, initials, Sign out and the 'Account security' menu item; the seed users plus the INVITED user with a logged invite link; the integration and Playwright tests.\",\n    \"FR-32 (LOW): AuditLog uses `ip`, not the PRD's `ipAddress`. Default: keep `ip` (no-rename rule).\",\n    \"FR-33 (MEDIUM): User lacks @@index([role, status]). Default: add it in an additive migration.\",\n    \"FR-30/FR-31 (MEDIUM): PRD-04's sendAuthEmail already enqueues to EmailOutbox. Keep it; the seed logs the invite link through logger.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3318,"cache_read_input_tokens":62