{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk6QsPcQvb24oTJBcD8C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Intake for SH-1 is complete. I updated the existing artifacts in `artifacts/intake/` after checking them against the current code. Each JSON file parses and carries ticket id `SH-1`, and `handoff-to-architect.json` was written last.\n\n**What's already built (the architect should not redesign these):**\n- The backend from the earlier intake: data models, tokens, sign-in check, sessions, middleware, rate limiter, audit helper, validators, services, all API routes, and `requireRole.ts` (its placeholder user is already gone).\n- Since that earlier intake, these are now done too: the `/login` page, the seed users (including the invited user, whose link is logged), and the `@@index([role, status])` migration.\n\n**What's left (the handoff lists these as the gaps):**\n- The `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password/[token]` and `/invite/[token]` pages, and `/account/security`.\n- `shell.tsx` still has its own placeholder user. It needs to use the session user and add the role badge, initials, Sign out and the \"Account security\" menu item.\n- Integration tests for sign-in, accept-invite, reset-password and change-password, plus Playwright tests for the auth flows. The unit tests already exist.\n- The new pages should reuse the existing `TextFormField`, `PasswordChecklist`/`passwordInputSlot` and `useToast` components.\n\n**Requirements:** 34 functional and 15 non-functional, with overall confidence at 97%. Each one has a confidence label, a PRD source citation, and a note saying whether it's already built or still missing.\n\n**Open questions (no one to ask, so I used defaults):**\n- The audit log keeps its existing `ip` column rather than renaming it to the PRD's `ipAddress`, because the PRD forbids renaming existing models.\n- Auth emails keep going through PRD-04's email queue. The PRD's temporary \"just log it\" version is not brought back.\n- SH-1 is used as the ticket id; the PRD header says SCH-001.\n\n**Other files:** The tech stack is React / Next.js 14 with MUI only, at 100% confidence. There's no Figma URL in the PRD, so I didn't create `figma-readiness.json`.\n\nThe dev phase needs the `mui-mcp` server to be reachable before writing any UI; the PRD treats it being unreachable as a blocker. It's connected in this session."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1211,"cache_read_input_tokens":57046,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1211},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ef677fc-a5ec-4701-b31e-b39b1716460a","uuid":"a48e6e97-9182-4543-b88a-8837a7737f95","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:26:31.725Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk6QsBxPuU12r2AqgW7U"}
