ls and migration (raw SQL CHECK plus two partial unique indexes), src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts, src/lib/validators/attendance.ts, the 10 API routes, the /attendance/take pages, the student and course Attendance tabs, /admin/attendance, the nav entries, the seed data and the tests.\",\n    \"REUSE: getScheduleForDate (timetable-service), notifyStudentAndParents/notify, assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, audit(), toCsv(), getSchoolSettings/updateSchoolSettings, and the components in src/components/<Name>/ (DataTable, StatCard, UserAvatar, PageHeader, Toast/useToast). These are not in src/components/shared/.\",\n    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM): there is no school settings page and src/app/api/settings/school/ is empty. Default: add a minimal admin attendance-settings UI and PATCH route built on updateSchoolSettings().\",\n    \"FR-16 (LOW): the daily register route is unspecified. Default: /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]?date=, reusing the course register component.\",\n    \"FR-23 (LOW): metadata for attendance.corrected and attendance.register_missing is unspecified. Default: ATTENDANCE category, email false; recipients are PARENT+STUDENT and TEACHER respectively.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n    \"@dnd-kit/core\": \"6.3.1\",\n    \"@mui/icons-material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material-nextjs\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-charts\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-data-grid\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-date-pickers\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"next\": \"14.2.18\",\nsrc/server/audit.ts\nsrc/server/csv.ts\nsrc/server/db.ts\nsrc/server/http.ts\nsrc/server/rate-limit.ts\n\nsrc/config:\ncourse-tabs.ts\nnavigation.ts\npublic-routes.ts\nstudent-tabs.ts\n\nsrc/server:\nattendance\naudit.ts\nauth\ncourses\ncsv.ts\ndb.ts\nemail\nenrollment\nhttp.ts\nnotifications\nrate-l