{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnB1QZXKGN2yQiS59VXf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Intake for SH-8 is complete. I wrote four files to `artifacts/intake/`: `requirements.json`, `user-stories.md`, `tech-stack.json` and `handoff-to-architect.json` (written last, with status `complete`). The three JSON files parse cleanly. The PRD has no Figma URL, so there is no `figma-readiness.json`. The old SH-7 intake files were overwritten.\n\n- **Ticket id:** your prompt says SH-8 and the PRD header says SCH-008. I used SH-8 in every file.\n- **Requirements:** 48 functional and 12 non-functional, each with a PRD citation. 53 are high confidence, 6 medium and 1 low; overall confidence is 93%. The MUI-only UI rule is recorded as NFR-7, as the PRD requires.\n- **Tech stack:** React (Next.js 14, MUI 9.5.0), as declared in the run mode.\n\n**What I found in the existing code:**\n- **None of this feature exists yet.** There are no file or content models, no `src/server/storage.ts`, and no content routes or pages.\n- **Five packages are missing:** `file-type`, `react-markdown`, `remark-gfm`, `rehype-sanitize` and `@dnd-kit/sortable`. The PRD allows all of them.\n- **School settings page:** `/admin/settings/school`, where the PRD wants the logo upload, doesn't exist; only the `PATCH /api/settings/school` route does. This is the one low-confidence item (FR-42). The default is to create a minimal admin page that uses that route.\n- **Parent access already works.** `assertCanViewCourse` already lets parents see courses their linked children are actively enrolled in, so no change is needed there.\n- **Daily cleanup:** the orphan-file purge goes next to `purgeOldNotifications()` in `src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts`.\n- **Code to reuse:** the existing rate limiter (`rateLimit()`), `audit()`, `notify()`, the course and student tab lists, and the components in `src/components/<Name>/`. There is no `src/components/shared/` folder.\n- **No root `.gitignore`:** the new `./uploads` folder still needs to be git-ignored.\n\nThese questions are logged as unresolved, each with the default I chose:\n- **File-type checks:** `txt` and `csv` files have no signature to check, and `docx`/`xlsx`/`pptx` look like zip files. The default accepts them when the check finds no signature or a zip/Office one, and rejects other mismatches.\n- **Logo storage:** the default stores `/api/files/<id>` in the existing `logoUrl` column, with no schema change. Emails will need the full URL with the `APP_URL` prefix.\n\nThe UI work depends on the `mui-mcp` server. It connected in this session, but if Dev can't reach it, the PRD treats that as a hard blocker."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":60005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":292},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c329f7d-691a-4a75-afbf-a9bd625b840d","uuid":"5fc4e4a6-d15a-47e5-98b0-d48138913ffd","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:48:01.216Z","request_id":"req_011CgnB1QLPFK8hWRZwCAmAx"}
