r), FR-60 (NO_SUBMISSION excluded from missing and reminders).\",\n    \"REUSE: notifyStudentAndParents(), notify() + NOTIFICATION_TYPES (category ACADEMIC), audit(), assertCanViewCourse/assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, registerBuiltInContexts in src/server/files/contexts.ts (add 'assignment' and 'submission'), the maintenance hook in src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts (add sendDueReminders()), the courseTabs/studentTabs registries, formatInSchoolTz, and the ConfirmDialog/EmptyState/PageHeader/useToast/DataTable components.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0 and MUI X 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4276,"cache_read_input_tokens":69730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4276},"output_tokens":42,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df495bd9-17af-4404-ad8d-134253d4d6e0","uuid":"da951437-f8d5-4ff6-9b63-8020ffa83d0d","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:23:20.134Z","request_id":"req_011Cgro59GaeFiHwwHVRRtKg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Adg6bGJa4XEXpAa2fnBZNK":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T09:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 78,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 95,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"DEPENDENCY GAP: PRD-08 (SH-8) failed QA. Its UI layer was never built: there is no FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView or Markdown editor component. PRD-09 FR-9/19/20/29/30 depend on them. Architect must decide how to cover this, e.g. build the minimal shared FileUpload and MarkdownView/MarkdownEditor in src/components/ inside this ticket. The backend is reusable as-is: POST /api/files (context field), GET /api/files/[id]?inline=1, registerFileAccess and the files service.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: @mui/x-internals 9.15.0 is mismatched with @mui/x-data-grid 9.5.0, so DataTable/DataGrid pages fail to compile. FR-17 (the teacher assignments table) needs it. Either align the MUI X versions in package.json or the lockfile, or render the table without DataGrid. This needs a decision.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: vitest.config.ts imports 'vitest/config.js', which does not resolve, so `npm test` does not start (NFR-13). Fix the import to 'vitest/config', or keep using vitest.tmp.config.ts.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: next.config.js has CSP script-src 'self', which blocks hydration in a real browser. The NFR-14 Playwright flow needs bypassCSP (as before) or a CSP fix.\",\n    \"studentTabs has no renderer, so the FR-41 Assignments student tab will be registered but not visible until a tab bar exists on /students/[id]/*.\",\n    \"LOW-confidence defaults to confirm: FR-15 (duplicate keeps the same dueAt), FR-52 (archived behaviour), FR-60 (NO_SUBMISSION excluded from missing and reminders).\",\n    \"REUSE: notifyStudentAndParents(), notify() + NOTIFICATION_TYPES (category ACADEMIC), audit(), assertCanViewCourse/assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, registerBuiltInContexts in src/server/files/contexts.ts (add 'assignment' and 'submission'), the maintenance hook in src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts (add sendDueReminders()), the courseTabs/studentTabs registries, formatInSchoolTz, and the ConfirmDialog/EmptyState/PageHeader/useToast/DataTable components.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0 and MUI X 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n"}}}
