t their status isn't changed to Published.\n- **Default due date:** \"next teaching day\" uses the existing weekday settings and ignores holidays.\n- **Extra credit:** applies to the raw score only.\n- **Admin's \"My assignments\" page:** shows the teacher's \"To grade\" list across all courses.\n\nThe PRD calls this ticket SCH-009; I used SH-9, as the task said.","ttft_ms":2935,"type":"result","duration_ms":249249,"uuid":"afca66e9-f761-4956-ad3b-3dd619cde8ff","ttft_stream_ms":2307,"time_to_request_ms":297,"first_content_frame_ms":2307,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":28,"outputTokens":25242,"cacheReadInputTokens":725794,"cacheCreationInputTokens":75551,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.2545187999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":4636,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":75551,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
