{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgrvXqofpfV8LMmFYzkB4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Intake for SH-10 is complete. I wrote 49 requirements (39 functional, 10 non-functional) and the handoff file for the Architect, with no blockers. Overall confidence is 96%, above the 80% threshold. The SH-9 intake files in `artifacts/intake/` were overwritten. All three JSON files parse as valid JSON.\n\n**Files written to `artifacts/intake/`:**\n- **`requirements.json`**: every requirement has a confidence label and a source in the PRD. Each acceptance criterion maps to at least one requirement.\n- **`user-stories.md`**: the PRD's own stories, one story per functional requirement, a non-functional section, and the 9 acceptance criteria mapped to requirements.\n- **`tech-stack.json`**: React with plain CSS, at 100% confidence. No new dependencies are needed; the drag-reorder, chart, Markdown and CSV pieces are already installed.\n- **`handoff-to-architect.json`**: written last, with the assumptions and the main risks listed.\n- **`figma-readiness.json`**: not created, because the PRD has no Figma URL.\n\n**Things in the existing code the Architect should know:**\n- No quiz code exists yet.\n- The \"maintenance run\" the PRD mentions should hook into the existing `/api/internal/email/dispatch` route, next to `sendDueReminders()`.\n- Shared components live in `src/components/<Name>`, not in `src/components/shared/` as the PRD says.\n- The decimal helpers in `src/server/assignments/grading-math.ts` should be reused for score maths rather than written again.\n\n**Assumptions I made, since there was no one to ask:**\n- **No sidebar menu entry (low confidence).** The PRD only defines the course \"Quizzes\" tab and direct page routes.\n- **\"Missed\" quizzes:** a quiz counts as missed for a student who made no attempts before it closed.\n- **Regrade:** it only runs when the teacher clicks \"Regrade\", not automatically when accepted answers are edited.\n\n**Main risks for the next phase:**\n- Correct answers, explanations and scores must never reach a student's browser before results are visible. This applies to the quiz, attempt and course-list endpoints.\n- Creating attempts must handle two requests at once, so a student can never end up with two in-progress attempts on the same quiz.\n- Each autosave must be a single database write that finishes in under 50 ms, to handle 300 students at once."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":914,"cache_read_input_tokens":52453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":914,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ff0d7d11-4ecb-4594-9705-5d04035e2cd1","uuid":"43d7dbf2-fdd3-49c7-9266-7e65803d1621","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:01:07.724Z","request_id":"req_011CgrvXqbH8vSF5k17ZxujN"}
