edule.\",\n    \"FR-25 (MEDIUM): the FR-1 schema has no field to store the 24h reminder throttle. Suggestion: a nullable Announcement.lastRemindedAt column and 429 RATE_LIMITED. The architect decides.\",\n    \"FR-17: when more than 3 announcements are pinned, the extra ones fall into newest-first order.\",\n    \"AC-8: the seed has no 6A section and no ParentStudentLink rows. The test fixture must create Pat's 6A child.\",\n    \"Shared components are in src/components/<Name>/, not src/components/shared/. Reuse them where they are.\"\n  ],\n  \"keyRisks\": [\n    \"NFR-2: isUserInAudience and the feed query must work as SQL/Prisma joins on AnnouncementAudience (OR over the type branches), not by resolving the full recipient set. The 200 ms target is for a parent with 3 children and 2,000 rows.\",\n    \"FR-7 / NFR-10: isUserInAudience and resolveAudienceUserIds are two code paths that must agree for every seed user. Keep the rule definitions in one place.\",\n    \"FR-27: publishDueAnnouncements must claim notifiedAt atomically (updateMany where notifiedAt IS NULL) so concurrent maintenance runs never double-notify. Hook it into /api/internal/email/dispatch.\",\n    \"FR-30: the 'announcement' file-access resolver must allow anonymous callers only for isPublic + PUBLISHED + not expired + publishAt <= now.\",\n    \"NFR-3 / FR-10: teacher audience checks must cover coTeacherIds and homeroom, and must reject isPublic and the SCHOOL, STAFF, ROLE and GRADE_LEVEL types on both POST and PATCH.\",\n    \"FR-32: NavItem has no badge field. Extend navigation minimally and reuse the NotificationBell polling pattern.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n"}}}
