d nav entries for /grades (STUDENT, PARENT) and /report-cards (TEACHER).\",","-    \"NFR-10 (MEDIUM): 'past due' = now > dueAt. Items with no term to place them in are skipped and a warning is logged.\"","+    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM): SECTION membership means current academic-year SectionMember rows.\",","+    \"FR-15 (MEDIUM): drafts may have zero recipients. The refusal applies only on publish or schedule.\",","+    \"FR-25 (MEDIUM): the FR-1 schema has no field to store the 24h reminder throttle. Suggestion: a nullable Announcement.lastRemindedAt column and 429 RATE_LIMITED. The architect decides.\",","+    \"FR-17: when more than 3 announcements are pinned, the extra ones fall into newest-first order.\",","+    \"AC-8: the seed has no 6A section and no ParentStudentLink rows. The test fixture must create Pat's 6A child.\",","+    \"Shared components are in src/components/<Name>/, not src/components/shared/. Reuse them where they are.\"","   ],","   \"keyRisks\": [","-    \"NFR-5 privacy: student and parent serializers must exclude hidden items, unreturned submissions and not-yet-visible quiz results. Sync only on return or visibility, so Grade rows never hold unreleased scores.\",","-    \"FR-31 snapshot immutability: regeneration must filter status = DRAFT, and grade edits must never touch ReportCard.\",","-    \"NFR-3: 600×8 generation must batch-load items, grades, overrides and attendance per course or term, then run the pure calc in memory.\",","-    \"FR-20: keyboard editing (E/M/Delete) within MIT DataGrid processRowUpdate and custom edit cells must be checked against the mui-mcp docs for v9.5.0.\",","-    \"FR-2: adding categoryId to the Assignment and Quiz editors touches PRD-09/10 code. Only add the field; don't change existing behaviour.\"","+    \"NFR-2: isUserInAudience and the feed query must work as SQL/Prisma joins on AnnouncementAudience (OR over the type branches), not by resolving the full recipient set. The 200 ms target is for a parent with 3 children and 2,000 rows.\",","+    \"FR-7 / NFR-10: isUserInAudience and resolveAudienceUserIds are two code paths that must agree for every seed user. Keep the rule definitions in one place.\",","+    \"FR-27: publishDueAnnouncements must claim notifiedAt atomically (updateMany where notifiedAt IS NULL) so concurrent maintenance runs never double-notify. Hook it into /api/internal/email/dispatch.\",","+    \"FR-30: the 'announcement' file-access resolver must allow anonymous callers only for isPublic + PUBLISHED + not expired + publishAt <= now.\",","+    \"NFR-3 / FR-10: teacher audience checks must cover coTeacherIds and homeroom, and must reject isPublic and the SCHOOL, STAFF, ROLE and GRADE_LEVEL types on both POST and PATCH.\",","+    \"FR-32: NavItem has no badge field. Extend navigation minimally and reuse the NotificationBell polling pattern.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"architect\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-11\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 55,\n  \"functionalCount\": 42,\n  \"nonFunctionalCount\": 13,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 95,\n  \"techStack\": \"react\",\n  \"figmaPresent\": false,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"assumptionsFlagged\": [\n    \"FR-6 (MEDIUM): removing a GradeExemption clears excused and re-syncs the score.\",\n    \"FR-7: getStudentQuizScore does not exist. Build it on src/server/quiz/grading.ts applyScoringPolicy + resultsVisible.\",\n    \"FR-13: in the seed scale 89.95 → 90.0 lands in A− (90), not A (93). The test should assert 90.0 and the 90-band letter.\",\n    \"FR-27/FR-33 (MEDIUM): add nav entries for /grades (STUDENT, PARENT) and /report-cards (TEACHER).\",\n    \"NFR-10 (MEDIUM): 'past due' = now > dueAt. Items with no term to place them in are skipped and a warning is logged.\"\n  ],\n  \"keyRisks\": [\n    \"NFR-5 privacy: student and parent serializers must exclude hidden items, unreturned submissions and not-yet-visible quiz results. Sync only on return or visibility, so Grade rows never hold unreleased scores.\",\n    \"FR-31 snapshot immutability: regeneration must filter status = DRAFT, and grade edits must never touch ReportCard.\",\n    \"NFR-3: 600×8 generation must batch-load items, grades, overrides and attendance per course or term, then run the pure calc in memory.\",\n    \"FR-20: keyboard editing (E/M/Delete) within MIT DataGrid processRowUpdate and custom edit cells must be checked against the mui-mcp docs for v9.5.0.\",\n    \"FR-2: adding categoryId to the Assignment and Quiz editors touches PRD-09/10 code. Only add the field; don't change existing behaviour.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GzEdMfn3ZbYSTJhQcx6zQQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
